  "settings_privacyBody": "Al-Abraar collects only the information needed to provide your learning experience: your name, email address, and usage data such as attendance and practice scores.\n\nWe do not sell or share your personal data with third parties. All data is encrypted in transit and at rest.\n\nYou may request deletion of your account and data at any time by contacting support@alabraar.com.\n\nThis policy was last updated: May 2026.",
